main\n\nMain branch (you will usually use this for PRs): main\n\nGit user: Sofiane Bebert\n\nStatus:\n M .codex/hooks.json\n?? pi-scheduled-tasks\n\nRecent commits:\nf605bc1 Merge pull request #74 from BbrSofiane/maintenance/followups-app-shell\nb1bb32c Merge pull request #73 from BbrSofiane/maintenance/followups-account-ui\n1f57dd5 docs: list the two new shell composables; the App.vue line target is retired\n254926c refactor(shell): move attachment chooser state out of App.vue\n3018ba5 refactor(shell): move viewport and contact-disclosure handling out of App.vue\n\nClaude Code attached this context automatically; it isn't part of the user's message. It describes the user's own account and workspace, so they don't need it reported back.\n</system-reminder>"}],"renderedRole":"user","userType":"external","entrypoint":"t3-code","cwd":"/home/exedev/email-os","sessionId":"415cd333-37f5-4cfe-be88-ad6fe867d94b","version":"2.1.326","gitBranch":"main","slug":"cached-bubbling-meadow"}
